msgstr "Yu&q"

#: commandShortcuts.cpp:110
msgid "The selected command will not be associated with any key."
msgstr "Saylanğan boyırıq berni töymä belän dä bäylängän bulmas."

#: commandShortcuts.cpp:112
msgid "C&ustom"
msgstr "Köylä&wle"

#: commandShortcuts.cpp:114
msgid ""
"If this option is selected you can create a customized key binding for the "
"selected command using the button to the right."
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä yanıq torsa, saylanğan boyırıqqa uñ toymä aşa üzençä töymä "
"çaptırmasın yasap bulaçaq."

#: commandShortcuts.cpp:119
msgid ""
"Use this button to choose a new shortcut key. Once you click it, you can press "
"the key-combination which you would like to be assigned to the currently "
"selected command."
msgstr ""
"Yaña çaptırma saylaw öcen bu töymä qullanası. Anıñ östenä çirtep, biredä "
"saylanğan boyırıqqa kileşteräse töymälär berläşmäsen basası qala."

#: commandShortcuts.cpp:142
